(place) at \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026..(time).\n\nSignature\n\n227Proceeds of Crime\n\nSCHEDULE VI\n\n[section 75]\n\nFREEZING ORDER\n\nI \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026.., Judge of the Hight Court of Sri Lanka holden in \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026.zone hereby make Order in pursuance to a consideration of an application made to me by Attorney-General/ Director-General of the Commission to Investigate allegations of Bribery or Corruption acting under subsection (3) of section 75 of the Proceeds of Crime Act, No. \u2026\u2026. of 2025 Judicially Freezing the under mentioned property.\n\nThe property above referred to : \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026..................................\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\n\n\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026..................................\u2026\u2026\n\n228Proceeds of Crime\n\nDepartment of Government Printing, Sri Lanka."
